---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Business Efficiency Apps — Spatialytics"
  description="Custom web applications that reduce overhead and support better wages for Greater Minnesota businesses."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <a href="/solutions" class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-medium hover:underline mb-4 inline-block">← All Solutions</a>
        <p class="text-cyan-400 font-medium mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Business Efficiency</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
          Software that reduces overhead and supports better wages
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Small and mid-sized businesses in Greater Minnesota often run on spreadsheets, paper, and tribal knowledge. Targeted web apps can remove friction, improve visibility, and free up capacity — so more of the business’s value can go into people and growth.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Examples of what we build</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Internal operational dashboards</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Task and workflow systems</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Cost, margin, and financial visibility tools</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Client portals and status tracking</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Lightweight CRMs and intake systems</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">The goal</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Cut repetitive administrative work</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Give owners clearer real-time visibility</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Support better decision-making</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Create capacity that can translate into better wages and retention</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card border-cyan-500/20 mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Related work</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">
          The Money Control SaaS and companion board are early examples of this direction — focused on financial and operational visibility.
        </p>
        <a href="/work" class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">See related projects on the Work page →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Discuss a business app</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
